  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Institutional capacity building to support the Electoral Commission in the Democratic Republic of Congo.</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This project will strengthen the capacity of the National Independent Electoral Commission (CENI) and provide them with the necessary resources and technical capacities to hold transparent, credible, and inclusive elections. In this project the Foreign Commonwealth and Development Office (FCDO) will contribute to an existing project implemented by the Consortium on Elections and Political Process (&quot;CEPPS&quot;) funded by the United States Agency for International Development (USAID).</narrative>
  </description>
